<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f6f8; padding: 30px;">
  <div
    style="max-width: 600px; margin: auto; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center;">

    ```
    <h2 style="color: #333333; margin-bottom: 15px;">
      Reset Your Password
    </h2>

    <p style="color: #666666; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;">
      We received a request to reset your password.
      Click the button below to create a new password.
    </p>

    <a href="<%= resetPasswordlink %>"
      style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 15px; padding: 12px 25px; background-color: #007bff; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 15px;">
      Reset Password
    </a>

    <p style="color: #999999; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 25px;">
      If you didn't request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email.
    </p>

    <p style="color: #555555; margin-top: 20px;">
      Thanks,<br>
      <strong>Your Team</strong>
    </p>
    ```

  </div>
</div>